WEBVTT

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:17.870
In an audition, they have you walk
for ten meters in front of the designer.

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.950
I auditioned dozens of places,

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:23.540
but they wouldn't even
let me walk two steps...

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:37.120
"If you're a model, an elementary schooler
would be a top model in France."

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:45.200
There's no demand for the model Chiyuki Fujito.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.830
You're ruining the balance
so could you step out?

00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:49.040
The crew of a shoot...

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:49.700
--With that height, you can't go to Paris.

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:51.870
--Even my dad...
--With that height, you can't go to Paris.

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:52.620
--Chiyuki, it's impossible.

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:56.290
--Even the person I look up to,
they all gave up on me...
--Chiyuki, it's impossible.

00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:58.870
So then, why...?

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:02.080
Why do you always...

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:03.540
Miss Chiyuki!

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:06.540
...appear when I need you...?

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:10.750
Would you like to be in my show?

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:13.080
Jeez...

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:15.200
I guess if you're going to twist my arm.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:20.500
Your words always save me.

00:01:23.870 --> 00:01:25.200
Miss Chiyuki?

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:27.790
Seriously, what is with you?

00:01:27.790 --> 00:01:29.540
You throw me off.

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:37.370
Ah...

00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:41.660
I went to Paris knowing
it was a long shot...

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:44.750
So I shouldn't be so upset.

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:48.290
But I had this encounter with
an amazing model a while ago...

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:53.750
She models unwillingly,
but her aura was so powerful.

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:56.040
I felt jealous.

00:01:56.040 --> 00:02:00.330
I've been dragging it ever since...

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:02.040
Oh...

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:02.870
What?

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:06.450
It's just... You never complain, Miss Chiyuki.

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:07.790
Huh?

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:08.910
I'm not telling you anything anymore.

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:12.200
Huh? Oh... I didn't mean anything weird.

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:15.500
It just adds to your charm.

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:18.950
But why?!

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:44.290
"Smile Down the Runway"

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:53.290
"Dressmaking Room"

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:54.080
"1) Complete design
2) Establish production schedule
3) Create a pattern
4) Create a sample"

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:57.000
"2) Establish production schedule
3) Create a pattern
4) Create a sample"
This is the timeline leading up to the show.

00:03:57.580 --> 00:04:00.790
"Episode 9: Rivals"
"Wind" is the theme for my show.

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:02.700
How does that relate to "wa"?

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:08.200
"Wa"   "Ring"   "Spiral"   "Typhoon"   "Wind"
It's purely from abstract ideas... But as long
as it associates somehow, it's allowed.

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:09.330
"Wa"   "Ring"   "Spiral"   "Typhoon"   "Wind"
I see.

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:13.580
You're going to make a total of ten outfits...

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:19.080
Hey, Ikuto. Since this is a show,
I wouldn't be the only model, right?

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:20.450
Huh?

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:24.410
What are you going to do
about the other models?

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:30.330
I was inspired by you to come up
with "wind" as the theme, Miss Chiyuki.

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:31.870
Huh...?

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:35.950
For typhoons, the smaller the atmospheric
pressure in the center,

00:04:35.950 --> 00:04:38.700
the stronger the wind blows.

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:40.000
Smaller...?

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:41.750
Are you referring to my height?!

00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:43.330
Please...

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:47.540
You push on like a typhoon,
despite what others think.

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:53.000
You encourage others like a wind at their back,
and comfort them like a warm breeze.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:55.870
Right? Doesn't it sound just like you?

00:04:56.870 --> 00:05:01.040
You're the star of my show, Miss Chiyuki.

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:04.910
I'd like to hear your opinion on it, too.

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:11.620
Gather only the top-notch models...

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:13.290
...so I can outshine them.

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:14.580
Yes!

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:18.540
I'm stepping out.

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:19.660
Oh?

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:23.410
You're free to go after you're done with that.

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:26.160
Oh... Thank you very much.

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:36.950
So... Whatever happened with Mr. Yanagida?

00:05:36.950 --> 00:05:37.950
Oh...

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:43.790
Well... I haven't been able to contact him...

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:47.250
What? Things are that bad between you guys?

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:53.120
I thought things were okay
thanks to my colleague, but...

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:56.160
Tell me more about your colleague.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:59.950
I'm curious since you mention them sometimes.

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:01.540
Oh...

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:06.790
She loves to make clothes,
but people are really against it.

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:09.120
But she's worked really hard.

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:12.000
She's improved so much,
she even made it to the finals.

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:15.620
She achieved results by working hard.

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:20.330
It's amazing, isn't it?
She's probably hard at work right now.

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:23.330
She knows she won't be recognized
unless she puts her all into it.

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:24.500
Ah...

00:06:26.910 --> 00:06:30.410
Hey, Ikuto... So I...

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:34.620
More than anything,
I want to prove people wrong.

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:39.080
People like my dad,
and a lady named Shizuku...

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:41.330
Ikuto, is there anyone like that for you?

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:46.410
Now that you mention it...

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:48.830
Then, let's show them!

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:50.330
Together!

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:52.830
Oh... Ah...

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:53.910
Yes!

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:03.160
Ah... How did we end up here?

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:06.290
It's best not to let quarrels drag on.

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:07.910
Ikuto! Stand on this side.

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:09.500
P-Please don't make me...

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:11.080
Come on, look sharp!

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:13.370
I'm not mentally prepared yet!

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:15.370
Huh? Ah...

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:22.290
Mr. Ikuto... And...

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:27.250
Miss Kokoro! I'm sorry for causing you
so much trouble. And...

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:28.120
Ah!

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:33.250
This is Miss Chiyuki Fujito.
She'll be modeling for my show.

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:34.870
Ikuto.

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:36.620
It's her.

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:38.910
The amazing model
I told you about before...

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:40.290
What?

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:44.000
Sorry for barging in like this.
Is Mr. Yanagida here?

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:47.000
Ah... H-He's actually gone right now.

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:50.870
I'm headed to a shoot right now, too...

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:54.540
I see. Then, you have to go.

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:56.290
Let's come again, Ikuto.

00:07:56.290 --> 00:07:58.000
I'm sorry.

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:00.580
Mr. Ikuto.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:01.620
Huh?

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:06.120
I'm happy that you came by.
I'll give you a call later.

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:17.160
She loves to make clothes,
but people are really against it.

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:19.750
But she's worked really hard.

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:22.660
I'm serious about making
clothes as a professional!

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:26.660
Miss Chiyuki...?

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:29.040
Sorry, Ikuto. I'm going after her.

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:30.870
M-Miss Chiyuki?!

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:32.450
Oh...

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.250
I'm so frustrated...

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:36.290
If you're serious...

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:41.160
If you're serious, resist now!

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:43.000
Get in.

00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:46.620
Hey!

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:48.620
Ah.

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:51.620
May I go talk to her for a moment?

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:57.660
I absolutely won't let you
get mixed up in this.

00:08:57.660 --> 00:09:01.790
Your dressmaking skills will never
surpass your talent as a model.

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:04.370
How about this?

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:07.580
Why don't you give her one shot as a designer?

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:09.370
Shut it, low-level model.

00:09:09.370 --> 00:09:12.910
What you're saying is not
even worth considering.

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:18.500
Ikuto Tsumura, you decided
to play designer with that?

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:22.000
Seems like you're no longer
in need of money.

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:22.870
What?

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:27.500
What? I only suggested that he ask
Hasegawa to model for his show.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:28.370
--What?
--What?

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:29.370
How could you?!

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:31.450
The offer still stands.

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:34.370
Use Hasegawa as your model.

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:37.540
That shorty will only burden you.

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:43.120
You might as well put your all into it.
You risked your mother's health for this show.

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:45.370
Now I'm mad.

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:48.370
If you think talent is everything...

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:51.870
Then, what if she has talent as a designer?

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:55.080
You won't have a problem
if she quits modeling, right?

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:59.370
If she uses a burden like me
as a model and achieves results,

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:02.410
she'd be a genius, right?

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:04.330
Ikuto.

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:05.750
Got it?

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.290
--Absolutely! Let's show them!

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:12.160
--But... I just know my manager
won't approve of me.
--Absolutely! Let's show them!

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:15.330
--But... I just know my manager
won't approve of me.
--I get to be in the finals...

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:17.290
--But... I just know my manager
won't approve of me.
--I'm so glad I didn't give up

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:19.200
and was able to challenge myself!

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:23.410
Together!

00:10:23.410 --> 00:10:27.450
More than anything,
I want to prove people wrong.

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:30.500
Yes.

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:37.000
I'm the model for Kokoro Hasegawa's show.

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:38.450
Ah...

00:10:39.830 --> 00:10:42.370
Thanks, Ikuto.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:45.000
We're now...

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:46.500
...officially rivals.

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:50.750
Miss Hasegawa, prepare for the worst.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:51.700
What?

00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:54.160
Mr. Ikuto... Um...

00:10:56.620 --> 00:11:01.870
So... If I succeed, will you recognize me?

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:05.660
You expect me to participate
in this reckless gamble?

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:12.540
If you don't achieve results,
you'll quit school and focus on modeling.

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:15.160
Is that right, Hasegawa?

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:16.160
Ah...

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:21.080
I'll only approve if Kokoro Hasegawa
wins the finals.

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:24.700
Get to the top, even if that means
defeating your friend.

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:28.750
Show me your resolve.

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:31.290
Yes... I will.

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:38.410
What should I do...?

00:11:38.410 --> 00:11:43.910
I was planning for Miss Chiyuki
so now I've got nothing...

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:45.410
Oh...

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:52.950
Ikuto, you better not be thinking
of losing on purpose.

00:11:52.950 --> 00:11:56.410
I want a real fight with you.

00:11:56.410 --> 00:12:00.000
You're my number one rival, Ikuto.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.250
So don't hold back.

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:02.750
Yes.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:08.870
I'm not holding back.

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:11.080
I always wanted Miss Kokoro...

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:14.330
Mr. Ikuto! I...

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:16.080
...and Miss Chiyuki...

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:24.290
...to get the rewards they deserve.

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:30.620
<i>Smile Down the Runway.</i>

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:37.120
Those pants have many parts
to be sewn. Don't let them fray.

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:37.870
Yes!

00:12:37.870 --> 00:12:40.870
Put the padding on the shoulder
to emphasize the waist!

00:12:40.870 --> 00:12:42.750
--Yes!
--His demands are impossible.

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:45.700
If he knows how to make it,
he should tell us in the first place.

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:49.200
That's our duty as patternmakers.

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.080
Ah.

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:55.250
Plus, don't you guys feel it?
How your skills are elevated?

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:56.160
Ah!

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:59.450
If you understand, get your hands moving!

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:07.830
One more... I need to design
one more winning outfit.

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:08.910
Toh.

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:10.450
Let's go home.

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:12.500
Grandmother.

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:14.950
I'd like to work a little longer.

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:17.040
You can go home without me.

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:20.370
There's no need to be so flustered.

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:29.540
There's no need to kill yourself
trying to surpass my record.

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:33.450
If you want to become independent,
you can do that whenever you want.

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:36.580
Thank you, Grandmother.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:39.540
But that's not what I want.

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:43.870
No matter where I go, I'll always be
the world's top designer's grandchild.

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:48.750
I can't go out in the world with mediocre skills
and disrespect your name.

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:50.870
I would never forgive myself.

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:53.830
You still call me "the world's top designer."

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:55.870
That you are.

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:58.290
And I want to surpass you.

00:13:58.290 --> 00:13:59.200
"Hayasaka General Hospital"

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:00.910
"Hayasaka General Hospital"
What are you writing?

00:14:00.910 --> 00:14:03.790
Oh...? A will.

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:07.120
That's not funny at all, Mother!

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:10.580
I have it prepared
so I won't have any regrets.

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:12.200
Enough!

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:16.250
Well, the operation went well
and I'm recovering just fine.

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:21.500
I'll be 100% cured! I'll never have
to be hospitalized again.

00:14:24.410 --> 00:14:28.500
I can tell, as always...

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:30.700
Ikuto, did something happen?

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:31.910
Oh...

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:39.080
Nope... Nothing at all.

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:43.000
When Mr. Ayano told me I have no talent...

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:45.750
...I felt broken.

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:49.000
When I was asked to sell my design...

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:53.040
...I wanted, more than ever,
to become a designer.

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:59.790
I felt excited when I was asked if there
was anyone I wanted to prove wrong.

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:05.870
But my goal is not worth
ruining Miss Kokoro's future.

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:10.620
Hey Ikuto, will you read that will?

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:15.450
Right now, I'm just so happy that I
get to even be part of the show.

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:18.120
It lists everything I want to do before I die.

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:19.660
Ah!

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:24.910
You were only six years old
when you started to sew.

00:15:24.910 --> 00:15:28.330
You designed the café's apron at seven.

00:15:28.330 --> 00:15:32.580
You also said you wanted
to become a designer at seven.

00:15:32.580 --> 00:15:34.790
You stopped saying that at 15.

00:15:34.790 --> 00:15:38.540
And you started to say you wanted
to become a designer again...

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:40.620
...this year.

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:42.040
Hey, Ikuto.

00:15:42.950 --> 00:15:45.370
"Go see Ikuto's fashion show."

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:49.080
Your family's going to come support you.

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:54.620
You can do it... Ikuto!

00:15:57.870 --> 00:16:03.950
The Geika Festival...
Will you be fully recovered by then?

00:16:03.950 --> 00:16:09.410
Don't underestimate me.
I'll skip my way over there.

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:10.910
Ah...

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:14.870
I can't lose.

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:18.450
I need to give it my all.

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:23.580
All right.

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:26.290
First, I need to come up with a new theme.

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:31.160
I can't think of any designs with
the Miss Chiyuki-inspired "wind" theme.

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:35.370
It needs to be associated with
the Japanese letter "wa."

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:43.540
The equal sign is called "wa"!

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:45.450
Those look like pants!

00:16:45.450 --> 00:16:47.540
I got it!

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:53.250
The theme is harmony, "chowa," and I'll feature
pants that harmonize men's and women's styles.

00:16:53.250 --> 00:16:59.080
Am I able to treat Miss Chiyuki
and Miss Kokoro as rivals...?

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:05.790
All right. It's done.

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:09.750
It's done, but...

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:12.000
I'm pretty sure I need to...

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:19.870
Whoa! It's already time to go to Geika.
I need to submit my model request form.

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:23.120
I feel... uneasy.

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:26.700
I saw a glimpse of his face earlier...

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:29.160
What if I run into him...?

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:32.330
I knew it!

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:38.910
Oh, no... But he did help me out...
So I should thank him at least...

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:41.410
Um... M-Mr. Ayano!

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:47.950
M-Mr. Ayano!

00:17:49.450 --> 00:17:54.700
Hey, Ikuto. Sorry, I didn't notice you.

00:17:54.700 --> 00:17:55.950
What's the matter?

00:17:55.950 --> 00:18:01.660
Oh... Um. Something seems different about you.

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:05.660
Is it because I'm not a patternmaker anymore?

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:09.290
Well... Who knows?

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:15.750
I think I know why I keep
seeing his face recently...

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:19.700
I fully intend to prove you wrong, Mr. Ayano.

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:21.450
Okay.

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:23.450
Good luck, then.

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:25.750
Toh Ayano, wait up!

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:27.950
Not you again...

00:18:27.950 --> 00:18:30.370
I'm swallowing my pride and begging you.

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:33.370
Let me be in your team!

00:18:33.370 --> 00:18:37.290
Like I told you before, I don't need you.

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:41.250
But why? I'm a lot more skilled than most...

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:43.410
Could you keep it down?

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:46.160
I'm on edge right now.

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:54.120
Hey... What are you looking at?

00:18:54.120 --> 00:18:55.000
Ah.

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:58.700
Ah... Well... Um...

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:00.580
Would you like to join my team?

00:19:00.580 --> 00:19:02.370
You mocking me?!

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:05.000
Who would ever join your team?!

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:09.000
You don't have to be that harsh.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:13.160
I only work under those who are
more advanced, and annoying, than me.

00:19:13.160 --> 00:19:14.160
Ah...

00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:20.120
I absorb their technique, aesthetics...
Everything about them.

00:19:20.120 --> 00:19:23.200
Then... I crush them!

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:26.830
You never defeated me.

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:29.580
Now leave before I get really mad.

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:34.950
Please... Will you please help me out?

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:37.370
A-Ah...

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:42.540
What? Why are you so desperate?

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:45.120
There's someone I want to crush.

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:49.580
I fully intend to prove you wrong, Mr. Ayano.

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:52.160
Please.

00:19:56.910 --> 00:20:02.580
Well, it's not a bad idea to use you
as a punching bag to relieve my stress.

00:20:02.580 --> 00:20:06.120
You're about to be schooled.
You better not complain.

00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:08.200
Ah...

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:09.370
Yes!

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:16.160
I focused my designs around pants.

00:20:16.160 --> 00:20:20.120
That's why I wanted your help--
since you major in men's clothing.

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:23.750
Pants, sure. There are many types out there.

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:27.040
But they all originate...

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:28.870
...from slacks.

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:33.750
Suit pants with a pleat down the middle.

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:35.870
His drawing is amazing.

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:40.910
You can assume all modern men's fashion
originates from the suit.

00:20:40.910 --> 00:20:44.910
Will you teach me how to make slacks?

00:20:48.830 --> 00:20:53.620
Women's designs incorporate curves,
while men's designs incorporate straight lines.

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:56.950
It's a totally different approach.

00:20:56.950 --> 00:21:00.870
Oh, man... I want to redo all my designs.

00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:06.700
Mr. Ryunosuke, you won't be
joining my team, right?

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:08.080
Oh...

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:11.910
Then...

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:16.290
Since I'm on my own, I don't
even need to draw a design!

00:21:19.120 --> 00:21:21.250
Thanks to you, Mr. Ryunosuke,

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:26.950
it's going to be fun finding "harmony"
between men's and women's clothing.

00:21:26.950 --> 00:21:28.290
Harmony?

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:31.410
Yes, that's my theme.

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:35.580
That's... The same as Toh Ayano's.

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:36.950
What?

00:21:36.950 --> 00:21:38.450
What are you going to do?

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:41.040
Oh...

00:21:41.040 --> 00:21:44.330
I won't change it. It's a head-on fight!

00:21:47.450 --> 00:21:50.870
And now, it's the end of summer.

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:51.790
"Rehearsal"        "Geika Festival"

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:54.790
"Rehearsal"        "Geika Festival"
Tomorrow's the Geika Festival.

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:59.450
Tonight...

00:21:59.450 --> 00:22:01.870
...I can't sleep!

00:22:01.870 --> 00:22:05.950
I think this will look cuter
if I layer the fabric here.

00:22:05.950 --> 00:22:08.120
I'm low on the red rayon fabric.

00:22:08.120 --> 00:22:09.080
Should I go buy more?

00:22:09.080 --> 00:22:10.500
Yes please!

00:22:10.500 --> 00:22:13.040
I want elegant volume in the shoulders.

00:22:13.040 --> 00:22:17.750
We can't take off the #120 thread and
satin so make it work with just a pattern.

00:22:17.750 --> 00:22:23.410
Bring outfits #6, #7, and #9 to me,
then go help with the others!

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:33.250
This feeling of being pressed
with a deadline... It's so familiar.

00:22:33.250 --> 00:22:38.370
I was able to arrange for
the lighting, sound, and fitters.

00:22:38.370 --> 00:22:41.910
All of this...

00:22:41.910 --> 00:22:46.580
It's everything Mr. Yanagida taught me.

00:22:47.790 --> 00:22:49.410
All right!

00:22:49.410 --> 00:22:51.000
I made it!

00:24:31.620 --> 00:24:33.950
Next, "Must Not Lose."

00:24:33.950 --> 00:24:36.910
"See you next time!!"
